{"ID":"20240118144950-hdonkcr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144950-hdonkcr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144950-hdonkcr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144950-uvprci0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171119-j4dixkb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171119-j4dixkb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:162,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:180\u0026#125;","title":"383补26神曲","type":"doc","updated":"20240204171414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144950-uvprci0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144950-uvprci0","updated":"20240122171106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"——辛能散气，甘调中，温开胃，化水谷，消积滞。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171107-805advd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171107-805advd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，乃以青篙苍耳野蓼自然汁杏仁泥赤小豆未和白面，如造酱法酿制者，药铺多于伏日为之。【"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171109-jr1iz3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171109-jr1iz3a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"性味】味甘，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171111-0twh45i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171111-0twh45i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】神曲为消食化痰要药，主化水谷宿食，行气调中，健脾开胃，治症结胀满，泄泻痢疾。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171112-8t5qsl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171112-8t5qsl7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本草】痰逆症结，泻利胀满：回乳下胎，治目病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171114-ev9euiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171114-ev9euiw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药性】主化水谷宿食症结积滞，健脾暖胃。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171115-lmzlcaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171115-lmzlcaq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】养胃气，治赤白痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171117-1o702as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171117-1o702as"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171118-cnfky1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171118-cnfky1t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】脾阴虚胃火盛者忌之，虚胀者亦不宜，又能落胎，孕妇宜少食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171106-upz6iok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171106-upz6iok"}},{"ID":"20240122171119-txic37w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171119-txic37w"}},{"ID":"20240122171119-j4dixkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171119-j4dixkb","updated":"20240204171414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26，诸位看这个神曲，这个神曲长这个样子。神曲是消化、消食化痰的药，健脾开胃，一般来说，不管是什么病，一般的病、或者重病，癌症，病人的胃口都不是很好，吃东西都不是很消化，一般我们都会加一点神曲在里面，帮助消化食物，帮助病人身体能够消化水谷。这个神曲，你看【主治】有没有，它能够治症结胀满，哦，健脾开胃，那【药性】呢，他说主化水谷、宿食，症结，积滞，健脾，暖胃，哦，所以，肠胃消化不好的时候都可以使用，放一点点神曲下去，用一钱，两钱，三钱，要看个子大小，只要是常常有肠胃不消化的病人，都可以使用神曲，辛散，他的这个功能很多。"}]}]}